    "Starport keeps matching stage files as verified-staging and journal files as verified-history, with no active destination. Exact retries retain the same selection and all admission barriers remain closed.",
    "Unknown, malformed, or changed baseline staging evidence refuses before target preparation.",
    "The same producer also includes the reviewed credential-policy journal changes from the preceding proof."
  ],
